  "note": "Sixth contract set on Robinhood Chain mainnet, planned: the fifth set with its collateral lane rebuilt a second time, after the second rescore. The price guard, the stock router, the treasury adapter, the credit pool and the collateral vault will be new; everything else carries over from rhc-mainnet-v5 at its addresses, under the 48-hour timelock that administers every contract since 2026-10-05, with the one-hour timelock at contracts.escrowPauser keeping the escrow's brake. What changes in the lane: a draw judges the guard's pending reading whatever its age once it was taken in an earlier block, so the pool has to have agreed with the feed at two of the keeper's readings, which one push held open across a single keeper transaction cannot satisfy; the timelock's guardian can remove a keeper at once, where adding one stays a 48-hour proposal; and a write-off slashes stakers only for the part of the loss the seized collateral leaves uncovered. Each deploy script writes its own section as it runs. The status turns live when the apps move to this set, and rhc-mainnet-v5 retires once nothing is open on its credit pool and collateral vault.",
